{"id":46776,"date":"2025-11-22T20:26:56","date_gmt":"2025-11-22T19:26:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-amesterdao-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-08-28T20:33:55","modified_gmt":"2026-08-28T19:33:55","slug":"meia-maratona-de-amesterdao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-amesterdao\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre A <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> (Mizuno Half Marathon) realiza-se no dia <strong>18 de Outubro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>, em <strong>Amesterd\u00e3o<\/strong> (Pa\u00edses Baixos). Integrada no prestigiado fim de semana da TCS Amsterdam Marathon, \u00e9 uma das meias maratonas internacionais mais populares da Europa, reunindo cerca de 20.000 corredores de todo o mundo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida agendada para as <strong>13:00<\/strong> na avenida Stadionweg e chegada apote\u00f3tica ao interior do Est\u00e1dio Ol\u00edmpico de 1928, a prova disponibiliza a dist\u00e2ncia oficial de <strong>21,1 km<\/strong>. Se pretende explorar a oferta de grandes eventos internacionais e organizar a sua \u00e9poca desportiva, pode consultar o nosso direct\u00f3rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-internacionais\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">corridas internacionais de estrada<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com chancela da entidade organizadora Le Champion, o evento garante um abastecimento impec\u00e1vel, excelente controlo de acessos, anima\u00e7\u00e3o ao longo do percurso e uma atmosfera festiva inesquec\u00edvel do primeiro ao \u00faltimo quil\u00f3metro.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">18 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 13:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Stadionweg \/ Est\u00e1dio Ol\u00edmpico de Amesterd\u00e3o, Pa\u00edses Baixos<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21,1 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Le Champion (Mizuno Half Marathon)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3h00m (tempo limite oficial)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Abastecimentos<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">A cada 5 km (\u00e1gua e bebida isot\u00f3nica)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 3 - GEOMETRIA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Percurso<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso da <strong>Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> liga a Stadionweg ao cora\u00e7\u00e3o da capital holandesa, conduzindo os atletas atrav\u00e9s do canal de Churchill-laan, da ic\u00f3nica passagem sob o Rijksmuseum, das alamedas do Vondelpark e terminando na m\u00edtica pista de atletismo do Est\u00e1dio Ol\u00edmpico sobre <em>piso de asfalto plano e liso<\/em>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O perfil altim\u00e9trico \u00e9 <em>completamente plano e veloz<\/em>, ideal para quem procura fixar a sua melhor marca pessoal (PB) na dist\u00e2ncia dos 21,0975 km com excelente fluidez de corrida.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 4 - CALCULADORA DE PACE --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Calcule o seu Tempo Alvo no Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;\">Utilize a nossa calculadora de pace para definir parciais ideais e gerir o seu ritmo de corrida com precis\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora-de-pace\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 0%, #8B5CF6 100%); color: #0F172A; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap;\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a><\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 5 - ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Amesterd\u00e3o<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para atletas e fam\u00edlias que pretendem pernoitar na regi\u00e3o antes ou depois do <strong>Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026<\/strong>, recomendamos reservas antecipadas em zonas estrat\u00e9gicas de Amesterd\u00e3o:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Est\u00e1dio Ol\u00edmpico &#038; Oud-Zuid:<\/strong> Zona circundante da meta e partida na Stadionweg, perfeita para acesso a p\u00e9.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Centro Hist\u00f3rico de Amesterd\u00e3o &#038; Canal Ring:<\/strong> Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o vibrante pr\u00f3xima do Rijksmuseum e Vondelpark, com \u00f3timas liga\u00e7\u00f5es de el\u00e9trico.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Eixo Zuidas &#038; Amsterdam Zuid:<\/strong> \u00c1rea hoteleira moderna e tranquila com liga\u00e7\u00e3o direta de comboio e metro ao aeroporto e ao evento.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 6 - GASTRONOMIA & ACOMPANHANTES --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia Regional<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A regi\u00e3o de <strong>Amesterd\u00e3o<\/strong> oferece um patrim\u00f3nio cultural e paisag\u00edstico rico. Ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o da prova, os participantes podem desfrutar dos sabores locais da gastronomia regional, como <em>stroopwafels tradicionais, bitterballen, queijos de Gouda e Edam e p\u00e3o de especiarias<\/em> em restaurantes t\u00edpicos da localidade.<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Guia de Acompanhantes &#038; Espectadores<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Os acompanhantes e fam\u00edlias podem assistir \u00e0 prova e apoiar os atletas em locais estrat\u00e9gicos como <strong>Stadionweg, Rijksmuseum, Vondelpark e bancadas do Est\u00e1dio Ol\u00edmpico<\/strong>, desfrutando da anima\u00e7\u00e3o e do acolhimento local.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO CROSS-LINKING --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Outras Provas Recomendadas na <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mesma Regi\u00e3o<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Descubra tamb\u00e9m outros eventos desportivos de relevo agendados para a \u00e9poca: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-amesterdao\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 7 - FAQS ALINHADAS COM FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas Frequentes <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">(Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026)<\/span><\/h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento realiza-se no dia <strong>18 de Outubro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>. Os hor\u00e1rios das v\u00e1rias partidas por prova e escal\u00e3o s\u00e3o os seguintes:<br \/>\u2022 13:00 &#8211; Partida da Meia Maratona (21,1 km) em vagas sucessivas na Stadionweg<br \/>\u2022 Meta no interior do Est\u00e1dio Ol\u00edmpico de 1928<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza a prova?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A prova realiza-se na cidade de <strong>Amesterd\u00e3o (Pa\u00edses Baixos)<\/strong>, com a linha de partida situada em <strong>Stadionweg \/ Est\u00e1dio Ol\u00edmpico de Amesterd\u00e3o<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis no Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial disponibiliza as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>21,1 km<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Meia Maratona de Amesterd\u00e3o 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 assegurada por <strong>Le Champion (Mizuno Half Marathon)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e os tempos oficiais poder\u00e3o ser acedidos na p\u00e1gina da prova no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Portugal Running<\/a> ap\u00f3s o encerramento do evento. A fotorreportagem e as galerias de imagens poder\u00e3o ser pesquisadas atrav\u00e9s dos canais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e nas plataformas parceiras de cobertura fotogr\u00e1fica desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":45320,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,41],"event_type_2":[627,1053],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46776","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-amesterdao-paises-baixos","event_type-corrida","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-europa","event_type_2-paises-baixos"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/487804621_9542425605801262_2489629555851275394_n-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46776","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\